      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "ARKit provides the app with this reason when the app is in state [`ARGeoTrackingStatus.State.localizing`](argeotrackingstatus/state-swift.enum/localizing.md) and the device is not capturing enough of the necessary live-camera imagery needed for visual localization because the user is pointing the camera too low.",
      "normalizedSource": "ARKit provides the app with this reason when the app is in state [`ARGeoTrackingStatus.State.localizing`](argeotrackingstatus/state-swift.enum/localizing.md) and the device is not capturing enough of the necessary live-camera imagery needed for visual localization because the user is pointing the camera too low.",
